The stuff in this directory makes GVs and puts them in a file for
later testing.  This is Alia's port of the Matlab GV stuff to
Python.  The mp_math programs used mpmath to create the GVs.  However,
the mpmath eigendecomposition routines took far too long to run, so this
effort was abandoned.

The np_gvs use NumPy to do the computations.

Summer & Fall 2025.

